### AUTH - Register
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "address": "Av. Corrientes 1234",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### AUTH - Login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### USERS - Get all
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users

### CATEGORÍAS - Get all
GET http://localhost:4000/api/categorias

### CATEGORÍAS - Get by ID (con productos)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/categorias/1

### PRODUCTOS - Get all
GET http://localhost:4000/api/producto

### PRODUCTOS - Filter by categoría
GET http://localhost:4000/api/producto?categoriaId=1

### PRODUCTOS - Get by ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/producto/1

### PRODUCTOS - Create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/producto/crear
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "iPhone 15 Pro Max",
  "descripcion": "Smartphone de última generación con chip A17 Bionic",
  "categoriaId": 1,
  "precio": 1299.99,
  "imagenUrl": "https://example.com/iphone15.jpg",
  "stock": 25
}

### CARRITO - Get by userId
GET http://localhost:4000/api/carrito/1

### CARRITO - Add product
POST http://localhost:4000/api/carrito/agregar/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": 1,
  "cantidad": 2
}

### CARRITO - Remove quantity
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/carrito/1/item/1/cantidad/1

### CARRITO - Remove product
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/carrito/1/item/1
